為靈侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"景侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001400","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"景侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001400","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"太子般","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001401","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"婦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001450","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"景侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001400","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001401","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"由同段太子般／隱太子友的明示語境續指；不是跨篇自動官稱匹配。"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"景侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001400","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m014-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"靈侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001401","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","book_id":"b-shiji-035","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p015","text":"靈侯二年，楚公子圍弒其王郟敖而自立，為靈王。九年，陳司徒招弒其君哀公。楚使公子棄疾滅陳而有之。十二年，楚靈王以靈侯弒其父，誘蔡靈侯于申，伏甲飲之，醉而殺之，刑其士卒七十人。令公子棄疾圍蔡。十一月，滅蔡，使棄疾為蔡公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"靈侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001401","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-