子而自立，是為悼侯。悼侯父曰隱太子友。隱太子友者，靈侯之太子，平侯立而殺隱太子，故平侯卒而隱太子之子東國攻平侯子而代立，是為悼侯。悼侯三年卒，弟昭侯申立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"平侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001404","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"靈侯般","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001401","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"東國","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001405","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"平侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001404","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001451","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"悼侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001405","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"悼侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001405","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0030","start":30,"end":34,"surface":"隱太子友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001406","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0035","start":35,"end":39,"surface":"隱太子友","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001406","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"靈侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001401","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001406","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"由同段太子般／隱太子友的明示語境續指；不是跨篇自動官稱匹配。"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m017-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"平侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001404","status":"contextual_pro